{
 "_doc": [
  "DJ R3X v2 kit: the paint each kit part wears and what it is printed in - the one table for the kit's",
  "colours. Read by assemblies/kit/assembly.py (manifest `finish`, SCHEMA.md 'Finish'; Build's Exterior look)",
  "and by sim/model/build_r3x.py (the Original rig's baked paint), so the two always agree.",
  "Keys are kit codes (the Large Cut STL stem without ' (New)' / ' - x4'; ' (DNP)' -> '_DNP'), matched",
  "case- and punctuation-insensitively. `paint` values are sim/web/src/palette.json classes; null = not painted",
  "(sits inside the droid). A kit file with no entry fails the workbench's finish check.",
  "The scheme (palette.json _doc): Oga's Cantina R-3X from neutral-light references - orange top/bottom rings and",
  "base; charcoal middle ring, top cap, pedestal and head shell; orange visor with cream bars; blue headphone",
  "cups; blue RX-24 letters on a dark plate (build_r3x.py splits the letters off); light-grey arms with orange",
  "wrist cuffs; bare metal on rods and pistons. The guide (DJ R3X v2 Guide.pdf) has no paint notes: its renders",
  "are CAD greys with the base in orange print; its parts tables name the parts (cuff, bar, gasket...)."
 ],
